---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Post-Surgery Rehabilitation in Faridabad | Neriva Health" 
    description="Safe and effective post-operative physiotherapy in Sector 45, Faridabad. Recovery plans for joint replacements, fractures, and orthopedic surgeries."
>
    <section class="section-padding" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary-blue);">Post-Surgery Rehabilitation</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--text-light); max-width: 800px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                Successful surgery is only the first step. Proper rehabilitation is crucial for restoring full function and mobility. We provide guided, step-by-step physiotherapy following orthopedic surgeries.
            </p>

            <div style="background: var(--bg-light); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
                <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Surgeries We Help Rehab</h2>
                <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.8;">
                    <li><strong>Joint Replacements:</strong> Total Knee Replacement (TKR) and Hip Replacement protocols.</li>
                    <li><strong>Fracture Repair:</strong> Regaining strength and range of motion after cast removal or internal fixation.</li>
                    <li><strong>Spinal Surgeries:</strong> Safe core strengthening and mobility restoration.</li>
                    <li><strong>Ligament Reconstructions:</strong> Phased recovery for ACL and tendon repairs.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Start Your Recovery Journey</h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--text-light);">We'll work closely with your surgeon's protocols.</p>
            <a href="https://wa.me/919650940281?text=Hi,%20I%20recently%20had%20surgery%20and%20need%20post-operative%20physiotherapy." target="_blank" class="btn btn-accent" style="margin-right: 1rem;">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
            <a href="tel:9650940281" class="btn btn-primary">Call Clinic</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
